      "body": "This failure now blocks the CI for multiple PRs :(\nExample: https://github.com/python/cpython/actions/runs/28853850174?pr=153253 Even 3rd re-run is failing.\n\nAnd since `san` job is required, no PRs are able to get merged which touch some specific files.\nShould we disable `san` job's required status for now?",
